data: {"id": "e3051d962d4b479b-thinking-parallel_evidence-730", "run_id": "e3051d962d4b479b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`，container `app` 仍在 `Waiting`，`reason=CreateContainerConfigError`，`restarts=0`。\n2. **Kubernetes 事件**：仅有 Normal `Pulled`（镜像已存在），**无 Warning 级别的 Event**（如 `FailedMount`、`SecretNotFound` 等），因为错误发生在 kubelet 解析 envFrom/Secret key 阶段，而非 volume mount 阶段。\n3. **Pod YAML 关键信息**：\n   - 容器 `app` 使用镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令为 `python3 -c import time; time.sleep(3600)`。\n   - **无 VolumeMounts**（`Mounts: <none>`），说明错误不来自 Secret/ConfigMap volume。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789057554107, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

